    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4677ed55e0d805cb509881",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "贩卖部的面包争夺战吗？感觉只要\n增加库存量就可以解决问题……是有什么不能\n多进货的原因吗？好，我来调查看看──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb3505dcc8b239fa0220524ee4f4344ebfdf80a75c6c1b049ee76c4f9cac1bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
