    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43dc47d623d7a2d62d1b390",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道是不是因为她个性太努力了。\n她一开始处理学生会事务，\n就一直没有想要停下来的意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd08209d65d6887c5ada9705e2ad860d0c7add1998537f201a580317cfa70192",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
